     <td><para unique="1046350">AVX512DQ </para>
      <para unique="1046351">OR AVX10.1<anchor id="+461174"/></para>
      </td>
     <td><para unique="1046353">Convert eight packed unsigned quadword integers from zmm2/m512/m64bcst to eight packed single precision floating-point values in ymm1 with writemask k1.</para>
      </td>
